{"id":"n47145-1-9","stage":5,"title":"동메달 · 铜牌","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47145-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 수영 경기 어떻게 됐어? 금메달 땄어?","zh":"今天的游泳比赛怎么样了？拿到金牌了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"수영","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영：游泳。","readings":[{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64611","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}},{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어","audio":"/audio/9b5be22a79f473c72762.mp3"}},{"text":"금메달","meaning":"金牌","explanation":"금메달：金牌。","readings":[{"term":"금메달","audio":"/audio/1dda52bd95e850b25155.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37205","senseId"